Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Configuration facts: input-read congruence, retagging,
 tag separation and chunk lengths, one public home each

- New TuringMachine/CfgFacts: Turing.Cfg.inputSymbol_congr, Cfg.mapState_const_eq_mapState_sigma,
  Cfg.mapState_sigma_state_ne and length_flatMap_const, each from published equations.
- Re-pointed: ExhaustiveReplay's xr_inputSymbol_congr and ZoneRebalance's zr_inputSymbol_congr
  (removed; their uses cite Cfg.inputSymbol_congr), CfgRecord's record_tag_ne (removed; its use
  cites Cfg.mapState_sigma_state_ne), SeamLayout's sl_rewrap and sl_tagged_ne_done (their bodies
  cite the new lemmas).

